Description: Advanced system cleaner and optimizer for Soplos Linux
 Designed to seamlessly maintain Boro, Tyron, and Tyson systems. It automatically
 detects unneeded files, clears caches, and removes old kernels to free space.
 Included features handle Flatpak runtimes, APT caches, journal logs, and initrd optimization.
